        {
          "id": "0c724eac-2aeb-4fb8-a380-d2f1f0c7ef4a",
          "memory": "By September 29, 2026, Alex's three-leaf basil grew to four leaves and was actually alive, with Alex saying the windowsill sun ended up being perfect. They joked the pesto timeline shortened from 10 years to 9 years and User was promised one leaf as a thank-you.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "f36f7030-8cab-4f50-8edc-64b864877de3",
          "memory": "As of September 29, 2026, Alex waters his tiny basil with a spoon so he does not drown it, having learned his lesson from the earlier tablespoon watering incident that nearly drowned it.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "5531a80c-5c56-4514-bf25-3f5d39ce74a4",
          "memory": "Alex sent his mom the keys-comparison photo of his tiny basil and FaceTimed next to it before September 29, 2026; she laughed for a full minute saying that is not green stuff in the apartment, with User joking it grew from 2 grams to 3 grams of green, almost a salad.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "2feb861a-8377-4296-9ee4-aa38bb304712",
          "memory": "On September 29, 2026, User got home about 20 minutes before 7:28 PM still in work clothes on the floor, but the couch was clear showing progress from the September 20 laundry floor camp. User had mostly finished that laundry except one unmatched mystery sock, joking the sock would crush the tiny basil.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "25cd4a06-5c93-4620-afc7-b66762f853bf",
          "memory": "Alex invited User to pizza at Mario's at 6pm on Saturday, October 3, 2026, but User declined due to a family visit weekend with Saturday dinner at parents' place. User dreaded dad's grill stories and 2-hour burger lecture and preferred Mario's, so Alex said he might do takeout instead.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "18b32007-a48b-4b1c-8bda-657e5b8a2ee3",
          "memory": "User recommends the garlic knots at Mario's as elite, with Alex agreeing they are always a must-have and dangerous.",
          "event": "ADD"
        }
      ]
    },
